## Spread Operator
Spread operator uses three dots (...).

It expands iterable objects like:
Arrays
Strings
Objects
Features of Spread Operator
Copy arrays
Merge arrays
Pass multiple values
Expand iterable elements

Syntax
...
Copying Arrays
File Name: spreadCopyArray.js
let numbers = [1, 2, 3];

let copyNumbers = [...numbers];

console.log(copyNumbers);
Output
[1, 2, 3]

Merging Arrays

let arr1 = [1, 2];
let arr2 = [3, 4];

let merged = [...arr1, ...arr2];

console.log(merged);
Output
[1, 2, 3, 4]

Adding Elements Using Spread Operator
let fruits = ["Apple", "Banana"];

let newFruits = [...fruits, "Mango"];

console.log(newFruits);
Output
["Apple", "Banana", "Mango"]